99.1, "end": 99.675}, {"text": "but", "start": 99.675, "end": 99.85}, {"text": "unable", "start": 99.85, "end": 100.2}, {"text": "to", "start": 100.2, "end": 100.3}, {"text": "reach", "start": 100.3, "end": 100.55}, {"text": "each", "start": 100.55, "end": 100.787}, {"text": "other", "start": 100.787, "end": 101.55}]}, {"index": 10, "kind": "prose", "text": "The theorem, precisely", "start": 101.85, "end": 104.075, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 102.075, "end": 102.188}, {"text": "theorem", "start": 102.188, "end": 102.65}, {"text": "precisely", "start": 102.65, "end": 103.85}]}, {"index": 11, "kind": "prose", "text": "In the presence of a network partition, a distributed system must choose between consistency and availability. It cannot provide both.", "start": 104.075, "end": 112.85, "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 104.35, "end": 104.438}, {"text": "the", "start": 104.438, "end": 104.525}, {"text": "presence", "start": 104.525, "end": 104.963}, {"text": "of", "start": 104.963, "end": 105.038}, {"text": "a", "start": 105.038, "end": 105.1}, {"text": "network", "start": 105.1, "end": 105.5}, {"text": "partition", "start": 105.5, "end": 106.325}, {"text": "a", "start": 106.325, "end": 106.5}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 106.5, "end": 107.15}, {"text": "system", "start": 107.15, "end": 107.575}, {"text": "must", "start": 107.575, "end": 107.812}, {"text": "choose", "start": 107.812, "end": 108.15}, {"text": "between", "start": 108.15, "end": 108.45}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 108.45, "end": 109.25}, {"text": "and", "start": 109.25, "end": 109.362}, {"text": "availability", "start": 109.362, "end": 110.625}, {"text": "It", "start": 110.625, "end": 110.925}, {"text": "cannot", "start": 110.925, "end": 111.275}, {"text": "provide", "start": 111.275, "end": 111.7}, {"text": "both", "start": 111.7, "end": 112.55}]}, {"index": 12, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why? Go back to the diners. The phone line is cut. A customer at Diner 1 orders the new lunch special. Diner 2 has no idea the special changed — its menu board is stale. Now a customer at Diner 2 asks \"what's the special?\"", "start": 112.85, "end": 126.725, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 113.125, "end": 113.325}, {"text": "Go", "start": 113.325, "end": 113.525}, {"text": "back", "start": 113.525, "end": 113.725}, {"text": "to", "start": 113.725, "end": 113.812}, {"text": "the", "start": 113.812, "end": 113.9}, {"text": "diners", "start": 113.9, "end": 114.425}, {"text": "The", "start": 114.425, "end": 114.637}, {"text": "phone", "start": 114.637, "end": 114.95}, {"text": "line", "start": 114.95, "end": 115.162}, {"text": "is", "start": 115.162, "end": 115.3}, {"text": "cut", "start": 115.3, "end": 116.0}, {"text": "A", "start": 116.0, "end": 116.2}, {"text": "customer", "start": 116.2, "end": 116.662}, {"text": "at", "start": 116.662, "end": 116.75}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 116.75, "end": 117.05}, {"text": "1", "start": 117.05, "end": 117.362}, {"text": "orders", "start": 117.362, "end": 117.7}, {"text": "the", "start": 117.7, "end": 117.8}, {"text": "new", "start": 117.8, "end": 117.975}, {"text": "lunch", "start": 117.975, "end": 118.275}, {"text": "special", "start": 118.275, "end": 119.125}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 119.125, "end": 119.575}, {"text": "2", "start": 119.575, "end": 119.825}, {"text": "has", "start": 119.825, "end": 120.0}, {"text": "no", "start": 120.0, "end": 120.188}, {"text": "idea", "start": 120.188, "end": 120.512}, {"text": "the", "start": 120.512, "end": 120.6}, {"text": "special", "start": 120.6, "end": 121.012}, {"text": "changed", "start": 121.012, "end": 121.525}, {"text": "its", "start": 121.525, "end": 121.8}, {"text": "menu", "start": 121.8, "end": 122.1}, {"text": "board", "start": 122.1, "end": 122.362}, {"text": "is", "start": 122.362, "end": 122.475}, {"text": "stale", "start": 122.475, "end": 123.275}, {"text": "Now", "start": 123.275, "end": 123.587}, {"text": "a", "start": 123.587, "end": 123.65}, {"text": "customer", "start": 123.65, "end": 124.087}, {"text": "at", "start": 124.087, "end": 124.175}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 124.175, "end": 124.487}, {"text": "2", "start": 124.487, "end": 124.762}, {"text": "asks", "start": 124.762, "end": 125.162}, {"text": "what's", "start": 125.162, "end": 125.362}, {"text": "the", "start": 125.362, "end": 125.45}, {"text": "special", "start": 125.45, "end": 126.325}]}, {"index": 13, "kind": "prose", "text": "You have exactly two options, and they are both a little awkward:", "start": 126.725, "end": 130.825, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 126.975, "end": 127.087}, {"text": "have", "start": 127.087, "end": 127.237}, {"text": "exactly", "start": 127.237, "end": 127.775}, {"text": "two", "start": 127.775, "end": 127.95}, {"text": "options", "start": 127.95, "end": 128.575}, {"text": "and", "start": 128.575, "end": 128.762}, {"text": "they", "start": 128.762, "end": 128.9}, {"text": "are", "start": 128.9, "end": 129.0}, {"text": "both", "start": 129.0, "end": 129.287}, {"text": "a", "start": 129.287, "end": 129.338}, {"text": "little", "start": 129.338, "end": 129.6}, {"text": "awkward", "start": 129.6, "end": 130.525}]}, {"index": 14, "kind": "prose", "text": "Diner 2 answers with the old special (stale data) — that's availability: everyone gets served, but not everyone gets the truth.", "start": 130.825, "end": 139.125, "words": [{"text": "Diner", "start": 131.1, "end": 131.412}, {"text": "2", "start": 131.412, "end": 131.65}, {"text": "answers", "start": 131.65, "end": 132.062}, {"text": "with", "start": 132.062, "end": 132.162}, {"text": "the", "start": 132.162, "end": 132.275}, {"text": "old", "start": 132.275, "end": 132.525}, {"text": "special", "start": 132.525, "end": 133.025}, {"text": "stale", "start": 133.025, "end": 133.425}, {"text": "data", "start": 133.425, "end": 134.1}, {"text": "that's", "start": 134.1, "end": 134.537}, {"text": "availability", "start": 134.537, "end": 135.675}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 135.675, "end": 136.225}, {"text": "gets", "start": 136.225, "end": 136.462}, {"text": "served", "start": 136.462, "end": 136.85}, {"text": "but", "start": 136.85, "end": 137.025}, {"text": "not", "start": 137.025, "end": 137.225}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 137.225, "end": 137.675}, {"text": "gets", "start": 137.675, "end": 137.912}, {"text": "the", "start": 137.912, "end": 138.0}, {"text": "truth", "start": 138.0, "end": 138.825}]}, {"index": 15, "kind": "prose", "text": "Diner 2 refuses to answer until it can confirm the menu — that's consistency: no one gets a wrong answer, but someone gets no answer at all.", "start": 139.125, "end": 148.275, "words": [{"text": "Diner", "start": 139.4, "end": 139.713}, {"text": "2", "start": 139.713, "end": 139.975}, {"text": "refuses", "start": 139.975, "end": 140.5}, {"text": "to", "start": 140.5, "end": 140.625}, {"text": "answer", "start": 140.625, "end": 141.025}, {"text": "until", "start": 141.025, "end": 141.312}, {"text": "it", "start": 141.312, "end": 141.4}, {"text": "can", "start": 141.4, "end": 141.525}, {"text": "confirm", "start": 141.525, "end": 141.963}, {"text": "the", "start": 141.963, "end": 142.05}, {"text": "menu", "start": 142.05, "end": 142.463}, {"text": "that's", "start": 142.463, "end": 142.775}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 142.775, "end": 144.0}, {"text": "no", "start": 144.0, "end": 144.35}, {"text": "one", "start": 144.35, "end": 144.5}, {"text": "gets", "start": 144.5, "end": 144.713}, {"text": "a", "start": 144.713, "end": 144.775}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 144.775, "end": 145.0}, {"text": "answer", "start": 145.0, "end": 145.65}, {"text": "but", "start": 145.65, "end": 145.9}, {"text": "someone", "start": 145.9, "end": 146.3}, {"text": "gets", "start": 146.3, "end": 146.55}, {"text": "no", "start": 146.55, "end": 146.725}, {"text": "answer", "start": 146.725, "end": 147.075}, {"text": "at", "start": 147.075, "end": 147.2}, {"text": "all", "start": 147.2, "end": 148.0}]}, {"index": 16, "kind": "prose", "text": "There is no third option where the diner serves the correct special without talking to Diner 1. That's the whole theorem. It's less a deep mathematical mystery and more a very obvious dilemma — dressed up in academic clothes.", "start": 148.275, "end": 161.3, "words": [{"text": "There", "start": 148.525, "end": 148.638}, {"text": "is", "start": 148.638, "end": 148.775}, {"text": "no", "start": 148.775, "end": 149.013}, {"text": "third", "start": 149.013, "end": 149.263}, {"text": "option", "start": 149.263, "end": 149.65}, {"text": "where", "start": 149.65, "end": 149.787}, {"text": "the", "start": 149.787, "end": 149.875}, {"text": "diner", "start": 149.875, "end": 150.263}, {"text": "serves", "start": 150.263, "end": 150.613}, {"text": "the", "start": 150.613, "end": 150.7}, {"text": "correct", "start": 150.7, "end": 151.075}, {"text": "special", "start": 151.075, "end": 151.5}, {"text": "without", "start": 151.5, "end": 151.825}, {"text": "talking", "start": 151.825, "end": 152.15}, {"text": "to", "start": 152.15, "end": 152.25}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 152.25, "end": 152.575}, {"text": "1", "start": 152.575, "end": 153.45}, {"text": "That's", "start": 153.45, "end": 153.9}, {"text": "the", "start": 153.9, "end": 154.0}, {"text": "whole", "start": 154.0, "end": 154.238}, {"text": "theorem", "start": 154.238, "end": 155.05}, {"text": "It's", "start": 155.05, "end": 155.325}, {"text": "less", "start": 155.325, "end": 155.537}, {"text": "a", "start": 155.537, "end": 155.638}, {"text": "deep", "start": 155.638, "end": 155.9}, {"text": "mathematical", "start": 155.9, "end": 156.625}, {"text": "mystery", "start": 156.625, "end": 157.1}, {"text": "and", "start": 157.1, "end": 157.225}, {"text": "more", "start": 157.225, "end": 157.388}, {"text": "a", "start": 157.388, "end": 157.45}, {"text": "very", "start": 157.45, "end": 157.725}, {"text": "obvious", "start": 157.725, "end": 158.175}, {"text": "dilemma", "start": 158.175, "end": 158.838}, {"text": "dressed", "start": 158.838, "end": 159.213}, {"text": "up", "start": 159.213, "end": 159.363}, {"text": "in", "start": 159.363, "end": 159.45}, {"text": "academic", "start": 159.45, "end": 160.0}, {"text": "clothes", "start": 160.0, "end": 161.025}]}, {"index": 17, "kind": "prose", "text": "Because partitions are inevitable, the \"P\" in CAP is really non-negotiable for a distributed system — so the practical question is: during a partition, are you CP or AP?", "start": 161.3, "end": 172.75, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 161.55, "end": 161.825}, {"text": "partitions", "start": 161.825, "end": 162.4}, {"text": "are", "start": 162.4, "end": 162.5}, {"text": "inevitable", "start": 162.5, "end": 163.3}, {"text": "the", "start": 163.3, "end": 163.475}, {"text": "P", "start": 163.475, "end": 163.775}, {"text": "in", "start": 163.775, "end": 163.963}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 163.963, "end": 164.575}, {"text": "is", "start": 164.575, "end": 164.725}, {"text": "really", "start": 164.725, "end": 165.025}, {"text": "non", "start": 165.025, "end": 165.875}, {"text": "negotiable", "start": 165.875, "end": 165.875}, {"text": "for", "start": 165.875, "end": 165.988}, {"text": "a", "start": 165.988, "end": 166.05}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 166.05, "end": 166.675}, {"text": "system", "start": 166.675, "end": 167.675}, {"text": "so", "start": 167.675, "end": 167.913}, {"text": "the", "start": 167.913, "end": 168.0}, {"text": "practical", "start": 168.0, "end": 168.5}, {"text": "question", "start": 168.5, "end": 168.988}, {"text": "is", "start": 168.988, "end": 169.5}, {"text": "during", "start": 169.5, "end": 169.888}, {"text": "a", "start": 169.888, "end": 169.95}, {"text": "partition", "start": 169.95, "end": 170.55}, {"text": "are", "start": 170.55, "end": 170.7}, {"text": "you", "start": 170.7, "end": 170.838}, {"text": "CP", "start": 170.838, "end": 171.375}, {"text": "or", "start": 171.375, "end": 171.525}, {"text": "AP", "start": 171.525, "end": 172.475}]}, {"index": 18, "kind": "prose", "text": "Choice, During a partition, Example systems", "start": 172.75, "end": 176.15, "words": [{"text": "Choice", "start": 173.025, "end": 173.35}, {"text": "During", "start": 173.35, "end": 173.662}, {"text": "a", "start": 173.662, "end": 173.725}, {"text": "partition", "start": 173.725, "end": 174.3}, {"text": "Example", "start": 174.3, "end": 174.875}, {"text": "systems", "start": 174.875, "end": 175.9}]}, {"index": 19, "kind": "prose", "text": "CP, Reject or block requests it can't guarantee are consistent, ZooKeeper, etcd, HBase", "start": 176.15, "end": 182.8, "words": [{"text": "CP", "start": 176.425, "end": 176.8}, {"text": "Reject", "start": 176.8, "end": 177.275}, {"text": "or", "start": 177.275, "end": 177.375}, {"text": "block", "start": 177.375, "end": 177.7}, {"text": "requests", "start": 177.7, "end": 178.113}, {"text": "it", "start": 178.113, "end": 178.2}, {"text": "can't", "start": 178.2, "end": 178.45}, {"text": "guarantee", "start": 178.45, "end": 179.0}, {"text": "are", "start": 179.0, "end": 179.1}, {"text": "consistent", "start": 179.1, "end": 179.95}, {"text": "ZooKeeper", "start": 179.95, "end": 180.675}, {"text": "etcd", "start": 180.675, "end": 181.325}, {"text": "HBase", "start": 181.325, "end": 182.55}]}, {"index": 20, "kind": "prose", "text": "AP, Keep serving requests, possibly with stale or conflicting data, Cassandra, DynamoDB, Riak", "start": 182.8, "end": 189.65, "words": [{"text": "AP", "start": 183.075, "end": 183.5}, {"text": "Keep", "start": 183.5, "end": 183.775}, {"text": "serving", "start": 183.775, "end": 184.088}, {"text": "requests", "start": 184.088, "end": 184.9}, {"text": "possibly", "start": 184.9, "end": 185.413}, {"text": "with", "start": 185.413, "end": 185.55}, {"text": "stale", "start": 185.55, "end": 185.925}, {"text": "or", "start": 185.925, "end": 186.025}, {"text": "conflicting", "start": 186.025, "end": 186.55}, {"text": "data", "start": 186.55, "end": 187.025}, {"text": "Cassandra", "start": 187.025, "end": 187.65}, {"text": "DynamoDB", "start": 187.65, "end": 188.425}, {"text": "Riak", "start": 188.425, "end": 189.325}]}, {"index": 21, "kind": "prose", "text": "A CP system would rather close the kitchen than serve the wrong special:", "start": 189.65, "end": 194.325, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 189.9, "end": 189.988}, {"text": "CP", "start": 189.988, "end": 190.45}, {"text": "system", "start": 190.45, "end": 190.875}, {"text": "would", "start": 190.875, "end": 191.025}, {"text": "rather", "start": 191.025, "end": 191.35}, {"text": "close", "start": 191.35, "end": 191.713}, {"text": "the", "start": 191.713, "end": 191.8}, {"text": "kitchen", "start": 191.8, "end": 192.325}, {"text": "than", "start": 192.325, "end": 192.5}, {"text": "serve", "start": 192.5, "end": 192.787}, {"text": "the", "start": 192.787, "end": 192.875}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 192.875, "end": 193.125}, {"text": "special", "start": 193.125, "end": 194.05}]}, {"index": 22, "kind": "prose", "text": "The thing everyone gets wrong", "start": 194.325, "end": 196.7, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 194.55, "end": 194.65}, {"text": "thing", "start": 194.65, "end": 194.912}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 194.912, "end": 195.425}, {"text": "gets", "start": 195.425, "end": 195.675}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 195.675, "end": 196.425}]}, {"index": 23, "kind": "prose", "text": "Here is the misconception to watch for at parties: CAP does not say a system must permanently pick only two of three, like some kind of loyalty program. When the phone line is working — which is most of the time — a system can be both consistent and available. The trade-off only bites during a partition. It's a fire-escape plan, not a personality type.", "start": 196.7, "end": 217.475, "words": [{"text": "Here", "start": 196.975, "end": 197.175}, {"text": "is", "start": 197.175, "end": 197.287}, {"text": "the", "start": 197.287, "end": 197.375}, {"text": "misconception", "start": 197.375, "end":